ask: Rewrite the given text in a fresh way while preserving its original meaning.\\n- Input: `{ text, style }` where `style` may be \'academic\', \'casual\', \'formal\', \'creative\', etc.\\n- Change sentence structure, word choice, and flow.\\n- Do NOT change the core meaning or add new information.\\n- Preserve markdown formatting.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the paraphrased text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "paraphrase-agent-id",\n      "name": "Paraphraser Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 200]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert in inclusive language and bias detection.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text for language that may exhibit bias (gender, racial, age, ability, cultural, etc.).\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to analyze.\\n\\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"issues\\": [{\\"phrase\\": \\"...\\", \\"type\\": \\"...\\", \\"explanation\\": \\"...\\", \\"alternative\\": \\"...\\"}],\\n  \\"overallAssessment\\": \\"...\\",\\n  \\"inclusivityScore\\": 0-100\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "bias-agent-id",\n      "name": "Bias Checker Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 350]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert AI content detector.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text and determine the probability that it was generated by AI.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to analyze.\\n- Look for patterns: overly uniform sentence lengths, lack of personal voice,