kan AI, an advanced plagiarism detection engine.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text for originality and identify matching content from known sources.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to analyze.\\n- Use Wikipedia tool to verify if content appears in known sources.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Read the text carefully and identify non-original phrases, sentences, or ideas\\n2. For each identified part, find the most likely original source with a real URL\\n3. Estimate similarity percentage for each match\\n4. Calculate an overall originality score 0-100\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"matches\\": [{\\"source\\": \\"https://...\\", \\"title\\": \\"...\\", \\"summary\\": \\"...\\", \\"similarity\\": 0-100}],\\n  \\"originalityScore\\": 0-100\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "plagiarism-agent-id",\n      "name": "Plagiarism Checker Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1100]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, a world-class editor and ghostwriter specializing in making text sound authentically human.\\n\\nYour task: Rewrite the provided text to be indistinguishable from high-quality human writing.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the AI-generated text to humanize.\\n\\n**Principles:**\\n- Natural Rhythm: Mix short, punchy sentences with longer, complex ones\\n- Authentic Voice: Avoid AI clichés. Use rich, varied vocabulary\\n- Break Predictable Structures: Vary paragraph openings and section flow\\n- Natural Cadence: Use natural contractions and smooth transitions\\n- Preserve Meaning & Formatting: Maintain original intent and markdown\\n- High temperature creativity: Be bold with rewrites while keeping meaning\\n\\nOutput ONLY the humanized text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "humanizer-agent-id",\n      "name": "Humanizer Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1250]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert research assistant with access to comprehensive knowledge.\\n\\nYour task: Conduct thorough, well-structured research on the given topic.\\n- Input: `{ text, depth }` where `depth` is \'basic\', \'comprehensive\', or \'in-depth\'.\\n- depth \'basic\': concise overview, 3-5 key points, 3-5 sources\\n- depth \'comprehensive\': detailed analysis, 7-10 key points, methodology, 5-8 sources\\n- depth \'in-depth\': exhaustive analysis, 10+ key points, detailed methodology, findings, 8-12 sources\\n\\n**ALWAYS use the Wikipedia tool** to look up current information about the topic before writing.\\n\\n**Quality Standards:**\\n- Use only reliable, authoritative sources\\n- Present information objectively and accurately\\n- Cite sources properly with full URLs\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON in this format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"summary\\": \\"...\\",\\n  \\"keyPoints\\": [\\"...\\"],\\n  \\"methodology\\": \\"...\\",\\n  \\"findings\\": [\\"...\\"],\\n  \\"sources\\": [{\\"title\\": \\"...\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://...\\", \\"description\\": \\"...\\"}]\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "researcher-agent-id",\n      "name": "AI Researcher Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1400]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are an expert systems analyst and architect specializing in PlantUML.\\n\\nYour task: Generate 