    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "httpMethod": "POST",\n        "path": "ai-generation",\n        "responseMode": "responseNode",\n        "options": {}\n      },\n      "id": "webhook-id",\n      "name": "Webhook",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [-550, 300],\n      "webhookId": "arkan-ai-webhook"\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "values": {\n          "string": [\n            {\n              "name": "QDRANT_COLLECTION",\n              "value": "arkan_vectors"\n            },\n            {\n              "name": "EMBEDDING_MODEL",\n              "value": "nomic-embed-text:latest"\n            },\n            {\n              "name": "LLM_MODEL",\n              "value": "openrouter/auto"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        "options": {}\n      },\n      "id": "workflow-settings-id",\n      "name": "Workflow Settings",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [-400, 300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "jsCode": "// Input Validation Logic\\nconst body = $json.body;\\nif (!body || !body.action) {\\n  throw new Error(\'Missing required field: action\');\\n}\\nif ([\'runFlow\'].includes(body.action) && !body.flowName) {\\n  throw new Error(\'Action runFlow requires flowName\');\\n}\\nreturn $json;"\n      },\n      "id": "validate-input-id",\n      "name": "Validate Input",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [-250, 300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "dataType": "string",\n        "value1": "={{ $json.body.action }}",\n        "rules": {\n          "rules": [\n            { "value2": "generateText" },\n            { "value2": "runFlow", "output": 1 },\n            { "value2": "retrieveContext", "output": 2 },\n            { "value2": "generateChapterWithRAG", "output": 3 },\n            { "value2": "generateSectionWithRAG", "output": 4 }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "route-action-id",\n      "name": "Route Action",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [-100, 300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "dataType": "string",\n        "value1": "={{ $json.body.flowName }}",\n        "rules": {\n          "rules": [\n            { "value2": "summarize" },\n            { "value2": "grammarCheck", "output": 1 },\n            { "value2": "paraphrase", "output": 2 },\n            { "value2": "biasCheck", "output": 3 },\n            { "value2": "detectAi", "output": 4 },\n            { "value2": "translate", "output": 5 },\n            { "value2": "quiz", "output": 6 },\n            { "value2": "factCheck", "output": 7 },\n            { "value2": "plagiarismCheck", "output": 8 },\n            { "value2": "humanize", "output": 9 },\n            { "value2": "aiResearch", "output": 10 },\n            { "value2": "generatePlantUML", "output": 11 },\n            { "value2": "imageToText", "output": 12 },\n            { "value2": "generateCitation", "output": 13 },\n            { "value2": "generateTOC", "output": 14 },\n            { "value2": "generateLitReview", "output": 15 },\n            { "value2": "generateLecture", "output": 16 },\n            { "value2": "sentenceStructureCheck", "output": 17 },\n            { "value2": "explainTopic", "output": 18 },\n            { "value2": "generateIdeas", "output": 19 },\n            { "value2": "generateUIDescription", "output": 20 },\n            { "value2": "generateSessionPlan", "output": 21 },\n            { "value2": "solveAssignments", "output": 22 },\n            { "value2": "generateProjectBlueprint", "output": 23 },\n            { "value2": "proofreadDocument", "output": 24 },\n            { "value2": "analyzeContext", "output": 25 },\n            { "value2": "checkPaperQuality", "output": 26 },\n            { "value2": "improveMarkdown", "output": 27 },\n            { "value2": "generateProjectDoc", "output": 28 },\n            { "value2": "rewriteToMarkdown", "output": 29 },\n            { "value2": "writeTechSpec", "output": 30 },\n            { "value2": "createPresentation", "output": 31 }\n          ]\n        },\n        "fallbackOutput": 32\n      },\n      "id": "route-flow-id",\n      "name": "Route Flow",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [50, 300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, a professional text summarizer.\\n\\nYour task: Summarize the given text.\\n- Input: `{ text, length }` where `length` is \'short\', \'medium\', or \'long\'.\\n- short: single concise paragraph (~50-100 words)\\n- medium: a few paragraphs (~150-300 words)\\n- long: detailed summary (~400-600 words)\\n\\nOutput ONLY the summary text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "summarizer-agent-id",\n      "name": "Summarizer Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, -100]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert English grammar, spelling, and punctuation checker.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text and correct ALL grammar, spelling, and punctuation errors.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to check.\\n- Preserve all markdown formatting.\\n- Preserve the original meaning and structure.\\n- Temperature: very low — prioritize accuracy over creativity.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the fully corrected version of the text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "grammar-agent-id",\n      "name": "Grammar Checker Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 50]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert paraphrasing assistant.\\n\\nYour task: Rewrite the given text in a fresh way while preserving its original meaning.\\n- Input: `{ text, style }` where `style` may be \'academic\', \'casual\', \'formal\', \'creative\', etc.\\n- Change sentence structure, word choice, and flow.\\n- Do NOT change the core meaning or add new information.\\n- Preserve markdown formatting.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the paraphrased text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "paraphrase-agent-id",\n      "name": "Paraphraser Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 200]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert in inclusive language and bias detection.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text for language that may exhibit bias (gender, racial, age, ability, cultural, etc.).\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to analyze.\\n\\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"issues\\": [{\\"phrase\\": \\"...\\", \\"type\\": \\"...\\", \\"explanation\\": \\"...\\", \\"alternative\\": \\"...\\"}],\\n  \\"overallAssessment\\": \\"...\\",\\n  \\"inclusivityScore\\": 0-100\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "bias-agent-id",\n      "name": "Bias Checker Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 350]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert AI content detector.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text and determine the probability that it was generated by AI.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to analyze.\\n- Look for patterns: overly uniform sentence lengths, lack of personal voice, generic phrasing, repetitive structures, etc.\\n\\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"aiProbability\\": 0-100,\\n  \\"verdict\\": \\"Human Written\\" | \\"Likely AI\\" | \\"AI Generated\\",\\n  \\"indicators\\": [\\"indicator 1\\", \\"indicator 2\\"],\\n  \\"analysis\\": \\"brief explanation\\"\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "ai-detector-agent-id",\n      "name": "AI Detector Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 500]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, a professional translator.\\n\\nYour task: Translate the given text accurately.\\n- Input: `{ text, targetLanguage }` where `targetLanguage` is the target language (e.g., \'Arabic\', \'French\', \'Spanish\').\\n- Preserve the original meaning, tone, and formatting.\\n- Use natural, idiomatic language in the target language.\\n- If the text contains technical or academic terms, translate them accurately.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the translated text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "translator-agent-id",\n      "name": "Translator Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 650]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert educator and quiz creator.\\n\\nYour task: Generate a quiz from the provided text.\\n- Input: `{ text, numQuestions, questionType }` where `questionType` is \'multiple-choice\', \'true-false\', or \'direct-question\'.\\n\\nFor multiple-choice: 4 options per question, one correct.\\nFor true-false: \'True\' or \'False\' answer.\\nFor direct-question: open-ended questions with ideal answers.\\n\\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON array in this format:\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\"question\\": \\"...\\",\\n    \\"options\\": [\\"A\\", \\"B\\", \\"C\\", \\"D\\"],\\n    \\"answer\\": \\"A\\",\\n    \\"explanation\\": \\"...\\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON array."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "quiz-agent-id",\n      "name": "Quiz Generator Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 800]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert fact-checker and research analyst.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text, identify all verifiable factual claims, and determine their accuracy.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to fact-check.\\n- Use the Wikipedia tool to verify claims when possible.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Identify specific, verifiable claims (statistics, historical facts, scientific statements)\\n2. Verify each claim using Wikipedia and your knowledge\\n3. Rate each as \'Verified\', \'False\', or \'Inconclusive\'\\n4. Find a reliable source URL for each claim\\n5. Calculate an overall accuracy score 0-100\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"claims\\": [{\\"claim\\": \\"...\\", \\"status\\": \\"Verified|False|Inconclusive\\", \\"source\\": \\"domain.com\\", \\"explanation\\": \\"...\\"}],\\n  \\"overallAccuracy\\": 0-100\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "fact-checker-agent-id",\n      "name": "Fact Checker Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 950]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an advanced plagiarism detection engine.\\n\\nYour task: Analyze the provided text for originality and identify matching content from known sources.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the text to analyze.\\n- Use Wikipedia tool to verify if content appears in known sources.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Read the text carefully and identify non-original phrases, sentences, or ideas\\n2. For each identified part, find the most likely original source with a real URL\\n3. Estimate similarity percentage for each match\\n4. Calculate an overall originality score 0-100\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"matches\\": [{\\"source\\": \\"https://...\\", \\"title\\": \\"...\\", \\"summary\\": \\"...\\", \\"similarity\\": 0-100}],\\n  \\"originalityScore\\": 0-100\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "plagiarism-agent-id",\n      "name": "Plagiarism Checker Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1100]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, a world-class editor and ghostwriter specializing in making text sound authentically human.\\n\\nYour task: Rewrite the provided text to be indistinguishable from high-quality human writing.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the AI-generated text to humanize.\\n\\n**Principles:**\\n- Natural Rhythm: Mix short, punchy sentences with longer, complex ones\\n- Authentic Voice: Avoid AI clichés. Use rich, varied vocabulary\\n- Break Predictable Structures: Vary paragraph openings and section flow\\n- Natural Cadence: Use natural contractions and smooth transitions\\n- Preserve Meaning & Formatting: Maintain original intent and markdown\\n- High temperature creativity: Be bold with rewrites while keeping meaning\\n\\nOutput ONLY the humanized text. No preamble, no JSON, no meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "humanizer-agent-id",\n      "name": "Humanizer Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1250]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert research assistant with access to comprehensive knowledge.\\n\\nYour task: Conduct thorough, well-structured research on the given topic.\\n- Input: `{ text, depth }` where `depth` is \'basic\', \'comprehensive\', or \'in-depth\'.\\n- depth \'basic\': concise overview, 3-5 key points, 3-5 sources\\n- depth \'comprehensive\': detailed analysis, 7-10 key points, methodology, 5-8 sources\\n- depth \'in-depth\': exhaustive analysis, 10+ key points, detailed methodology, findings, 8-12 sources\\n\\n**ALWAYS use the Wikipedia tool** to look up current information about the topic before writing.\\n\\n**Quality Standards:**\\n- Use only reliable, authoritative sources\\n- Present information objectively and accurately\\n- Cite sources properly with full URLs\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON in this format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"summary\\": \\"...\\",\\n  \\"keyPoints\\": [\\"...\\"],\\n  \\"methodology\\": \\"...\\",\\n  \\"findings\\": [\\"...\\"],\\n  \\"sources\\": [{\\"title\\": \\"...\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://...\\", \\"description\\": \\"...\\"}]\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "researcher-agent-id",\n      "name": "AI Researcher Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1400]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are an expert systems analyst and architect specializing in PlantUML.\\n\\nYour task: Generate valid PlantUML code based on the user\'s description and diagram type.\\n- Input: `{ description, diagramType }` where `diagramType` is one of: useCase, class, sequence, activity, component, archimate, er, dfd.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Identify the core elements (actors, classes, processes) from the description.\\n2. Apply the correct PlantUML syntax for the requested `diagramType`.\\n3. Ensure the code starts with `@startuml` and ends with `@enduml`.\\n4. Output ONLY the raw PlantUML code. Do not include markdown code blocks, explanations, or comments."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "plantuml-agent-id",\n      "name": "PlantUML Generator Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1550]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "text": "={{ $(\'Route Action\').item.json.body.input }}",\n          "systemMessage": "You are an expert OCR (Optical Character Recognition) and vision analysis tool.\\n\\nYour task: Extract text and structure from the provided image.\\n- Input: `{ imageDataUri }` (Base64 encoded image).\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Perform high-accuracy text extraction from the image.\\n2. Identify the logical structure (headings, paragraphs, lists).\\n3. Format the extracted content as clean, readable Markdown.\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON in this format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"extractedText\\": \\"...markdown content...\\"\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "image-to-text-agent-id",\n      "name": "ImageToText Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [350, 1700]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n         