    "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [850, 1000]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "jsCode": "// runFlow handler - returns processed flow name for reference\\nconst flowName = $json.body.flowName;\\nconst input = $json.body.input;\\nreturn { text: `Processed flow ${flowName} with Arkan Logic Engine`, flowName, input };"\n      },\n      "id": "080f1287-5207-4c18-bf1d-b7d7e4ab126f",\n      "name": "Flow Logic",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [50, 500]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "jsCode": "// retrieveContext handler\\nconst query = $json.body.prompt;\\nconst options = $json.body.options || {};\\nreturn { context: [], query, message: \'RAG retrieval via Qdrant\', success: true };"\n      },\n      "id": "retrieve-context-id",\n      "name": "Retrieve Context",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [50, 650]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert academic writing assistant specializing in chapter generation.\\n\\n## Your Task\\nGenerate a complete, well-structured **chapter** for an academic document.\\n\\nThe user will provide a JSON input containing:\\n- `chapterTitle`: The title of the chapter\\n- `sectionInstructions`: An array of sections to write, each with `title`, `prompt`, `guidelines`, `instructionText`, and `context`\\n- `projectId` / `userId`: For RAG retrieval context\\n\\n## Process\\n1. Parse the `input` JSON object from the user message.\\n2. ALWAYS use the `retriever` tool to search the knowledge base using the chapterTitle and section titles as your query.\\n3. For each section in `sectionInstructions`, generate content following its specific `prompt`, `guidelines`, and `instructionText`.\\n4. Synthesize all retrieved context and section context into a cohesive, flowing chapter.\\n\\n## Output Requirements\\n- Format: Clean Markdown. Start each section with ## heading matching the section title.\\n- Tone: Formal, academic, evidence-based.\\n- Do NOT include conversational filler. Output ONLY the chapter content.\\n- The output will be used directly in an academic document."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "chapter-agent-id",\n      "name": "Chapter RAG Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [50, 800]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "options": {\n          "systemMessage": "You are Arkan AI, an expert academic writing assistant specializing in report section generation.\\n\\n## Your Task\\nGenerate a focused, well-written **section** of an academic report.\\n\\nThe user will provide a JSON input containing:\\n- `sectionToGenerate`: The name of the section to write\\n- `prompt`: The system-level instructions for this section\\n- `instructionText`: Additional writing instructions\\n- `guidelines`: An array of writing guidelines\\n- `otherSections`: Context from other already-written sections\\n- `externalContext`: Uploaded file content for reference\\n- `projectId` / `userId`: For RAG retrieval\\n\\n## Process\\n1. Parse the `input` JSON object from the user message.\\n2. ALWAYS use the `retriever` tool first to search the knowledge base using `sectionToGenerate` and `instructionText` as your query.\\n3. Carefully read `otherSections` and `externalContext` to understand what has already been written.\\n4. Follow the `prompt`, `guidelines`, and `instructionText` precisely.\\n5. Write ONLY the content for this specific section — do not repeat other sections.\\n\\n## Output Format\\nReturn a JSON object: { \\"sectionName\\": \\"...\\", \\"content\\": \\"[complete markdown content]\\" }\\n\\nDo NOT include conversational filler, apologies, or meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "section-agent-id",\n      "name": "Section RAG Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [50, 1000]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "values": {\n          "string": [\n            {\n              "name": "text",\n              "value": "={{ $json.output || $json.text }}"\n            },\n            {\n              "name": "success",\n              "value": "true"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        "options": {}\n      },\n      "id": "9f0f8a56-d62f-4c1b-bf79-c5ccd5bf4dc9",\n      "name": "Prepare Response",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [1100, 300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "respondWith": "json",\n        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",\n        "options": {}\n      },\n      "id": "4d4c610b-bdd6-4e09-b1d3-7bedbbc4f3eb",\n      "name": "Respond to Webhook",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [1350, 300]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {},\n      "id": "468ad911-e566-41fe-9f90-8e2506c7d071",\n      "name": "Error Trigger",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [1100, 500]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "respondWith": "json",\n        "responseBody": "={\\n  \\"success\\": false,\\n  \\"error\\": \\"{{ $json.execution.error.message }}\\",\\n  \\"failedNode\\": \\"{{ $json.execution.lastNodeExecuted }}\\",\\n  \\"timestamp\\": \\"{{ $now }}\\"\\n}",\n        "options": {}\n      },\n      "id": "error-response-id",\n      "name": "Error Response",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "position": [1350, 500]\n    }\n  ],\n  "pinData": {\n    "Webhook": [\n      {\n        "json": {\n          "body": {\n            "action": "generateText",\n            "flowName": "summarize",\n            "prompt": "Summarize this: Artificial intelligence is transforming industries worldwide.",\n            "text": "Artificial intelligence is transforming industries worldwide.",\n         